{"questions":[{"question_id":"1l1nwjnsl","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2013 Paper 2 Offline","year":2013,"examDate":2013,"subject":"physics","chapter":"magnetism","chapterGroup":"electricity","topic":"amperes-circuital-law","type":"mcqm","marks":4,"negMarks":2,"permalink":"pa-steady-current-i-flows-along-an-infinitely-long-hollow-jee-advanced-physics-units-and-measurements-bcw0h1lfcnk5em2a","content":"<p>A steady current I flows along an infinitely long hollow cylindrical conductor of radius R. This cylinder is placed coaxially inside an infinite solenoid of radius 2R. The solenoid has n turns per unit length and carries a steady current I. Consider a point P at a distance r from the common axis. The correct statement(s) is(are)</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"In the region 0 < r < R, the magnetic field is non-zero."},{"identifier":"B","content":"In the region R < r < 2R, the magnetic field is along the common axis."},{"identifier":"C","content":"In the region R < r < 2R, the magnetic field is tangential to the circle of radius r, centred on the axis."},{"identifier":"D","content":"In the region r > 2R, the magnetic field is non-zero."}],"correct_options":["A","D"],"explanation":"<p>We know that</p>\n<p>(i) For a cylinder, B = 0 for 0 &lt; r &lt; R and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.814ex\" height=\"2.782ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 5663.7 1229.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2092.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(231.8,492.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"958.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3513.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4513.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(415.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><rect width=\"909.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> for r &gt; R.</p>\n<p>(ii) For a solenoid, B = <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.364ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 603 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>0</sub>nI for  0 &lt; r &lt; R and B = 0 for r &gt; R.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2013 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Magnetism Question 31 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l1qhgzof/97d8c3c3-e8d9-49b9-80fa-9e9c1ffa1ab2/89ec92f0-b742-11ec-885a-17f955768420/file-1l1qhgzog.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Assuming that the magnetic induction to be B<sub>C</sub> for cylinder and B<sub>S</sub> for solenoid.</p>\n<p>In the region R &gt; r &gt; 0, B<sub>S</sub> = <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.364ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 603 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>0</sub>nI while B<sub>C</sub> = 0. Therefore, the total field is non-zero.</p>\n<p>Hence, option (A) is correct.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> In the region 2R &lt; r &lt; R, the magnetic field is not along the axis of cylinder which is given as</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.336ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.865ex\" height=\"4.208ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1269.5 7012.5 1860\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(2092.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,59.5)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(1020,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(792,353.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(792,-324.9) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1520.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(2520.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(792,353.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(792,-324.9) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g></g></g><rect width=\"3899.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"1020\" y=\"1149.5\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, option (B) is wrong.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> For checking option (C), in the region R &lt; r &lt; 2R, the magnetic field is tangential to the circle of radius r, centred on the axis. So this statement is wrong because magnetic field is not in the plane of circle.</p>\n<p>Hence, option (C) is wrong.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> In the region r &gt; 2, B<sub>S</sub> = 0; while <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.217ex\" height=\"2.782ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 6284.1 1229.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(792,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1657.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2713,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(231.8,492.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"958.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4133.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5134.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(415.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><rect width=\"909.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Therefore total field is non-zero.</p>\n<p>Hence, option (D) is correct.</p>"}]}